<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,292.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,292.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,292 today from 1,293 on Aug 15, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1336    12.125	  1344    12.200</p>
<p>   1a   1248  9450.000	  1251  9471.000</p>
